{"name":"The World Key","slug":"glyph-world-key","blurb":"On the depth street, Bay carries the key toward the bracket lamp. The mark is World. Click the key and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The World Key.","seal":"00bdd0b1b31a08eed1cb8df069e501ae7ae16e32bdacb79f5371d2aa38a010c9"}
